{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Little Nightmares</strong> series has been captivating millions of players worldwide since 2017. Now it\u2019s your turn to try to survive the first entry in most charming horror series ever made. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Six, a lone child lost in a massive metal vessel known as the Maw, surrounded by dangerous, distorted versions of adults. You\u2019ll need to do your best to escape in one piece or your fate will be worse than you ever dared dream. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>OBSERVE YOUR SURROUNDINGS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a damp, dark room. Your sole possession is a brass lighter. You have no memory of how you got here, but it\u2019s clear that you are in danger. Only your keen eyes and quick wits can get you out in one piece. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/e89a0cb5f6c1a142d87d71f8626c62ba.poster.avif?t=1773135169\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/e89a0cb5f6c1a142d87d71f8626c62ba.webm?t=1773135169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>FIND AN ESCAPE ROUTE</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is not meant for children, but you can use your stature as an advantage with a bit of imagination. Climb drawers and shelves to find child-sized passageways through The Maw too tiny for the adults to reach and you\u2019ll be safe\u2026 <i>at least for a while.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/9a6b33a5398bb423e8888acac6694875.poster.avif?t=1773135169\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/9a6b33a5398bb423e8888acac6694875.webm?t=1773135169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>AVOID THE RESIDENTS</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhabitants of the Maw have only one use for children, and it\u2019s never pretty. Children who don\u2019t want to get caught should stay hidden and move carefully when they\u2019re around. Under certain circumstances, a distraction might avert their attention long enough for you to scuttle away scott-free. Be careful, if you accidentally make too much noise, the Residents are <i>quite determined</i> once you\u2019ve caught their eye. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/40505875083490228884fba947e9ae2d.poster.avif?t=1773135169\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/40505875083490228884fba947e9ae2d.webm?t=1773135169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>RUN FOR YOUR LIFE</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, there\u2019s no other choice but to run. If you can stay alive long enough to get somewhere the Residents can\u2019t reach you, you <i>might</i> survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/49342b9ab1325a23f8cd8f521679d24d.poster.avif?t=1773135169\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/49342b9ab1325a23f8cd8f521679d24d.webm?t=1773135169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it through the Maw to freedom? Six is counting on you. <i>Good luck, little one.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Little Lost Things","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/2db89ed8020ab7a16715a9da8bb13d4aa377362b.jpg"},{"name":"Kitchen Hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/c38cd433ab0da4286ed46469848d23d713a683d3.jpg"},{"name":"Highly Sprung","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/9ee4e9e87137337ba577e65cfdf9ae93352be052.jpg"},{"name":"Rascal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/b1816b4d3d62b3ecdb51e084560dd6769ad6fcbf.jpg"},{"name":"Light Up Your Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/20f23da299c25e98b1fa8dbc8fefa5d05be467ef.jpg"},{"name":"The Prison","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/28353a41c818fa0d905c12d84ae2e3e1bb5c0d9f.jpg"},{"name":"The Lair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/852034c21dd269c8af8bea087b4c2654012be7aa.jpg"},{"name":"The Kitchen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/1b42737e96c13204b504eb8f2c29841292e3b68d.jpg"},{"name":"The Guest Area","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/7cd9b93aa76075f22fc7cf3db10f2e8a53819349.jpg"},{"name":"The Lady's Quarters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/424840/f838ce2088c7426ba5a0f2372dce51c94ac62d96.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/424840?t=1773135169","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/61b12d0ab0f1b312f863e33776b58050837fcf38/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773135169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/2bdbdbe316dba829ab67ea61528ab87a156fc2ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773135169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/2bdbdbe316dba829ab67ea61528ab87a156fc2ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773135169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>PC Enhanced Edition \u2728</h1><p>(Re)-Discover the dark whimsical tale of Little Nightmares, now enhanced in <strong>stunning 4K and 60 FPS</strong>. <br><br>Enjoy <strong>improved visual effects</strong>, including <strong>RTX reflections</strong>, <strong>water effects</strong>, <strong>more particles</strong>, and <strong>volumetric lighting</strong>. <br><br>Additional helpers have been added for an overall better experience. </p><br><h1>Special Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/6df2a0801a3a68c36c39d6bb355df91d.avif?t=1773135169\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCLUDES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Nightmares\u2122 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Nightmares\u2122 Secrets of The Maw Expansion Pass</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Little Nightmares</strong> series has been captivating millions of players worldwide since 2017. Now it\u2019s your turn to try to survive the first entry in most charming horror series ever made. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Six, a lone child lost in a massive metal vessel known as the Maw, surrounded by dangerous, distorted versions of adults. You\u2019ll need to do your best to escape in one piece or your fate will be worse than you ever dared dream. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>OBSERVE YOUR SURROUNDINGS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a damp, dark room. Your sole possession is a brass lighter. You have no memory of how you got here, but it\u2019s clear that you are in danger. Only your keen eyes and quick wits can get you out in one piece. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/e89a0cb5f6c1a142d87d71f8626c62ba.poster.avif?t=1773135169\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/e89a0cb5f6c1a142d87d71f8626c62ba.webm?t=1773135169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>FIND AN ESCAPE ROUTE</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is not meant for children, but you can use your stature as an advantage with a bit of imagination. Climb drawers and shelves to find child-sized passageways through The Maw too tiny for the adults to reach and you\u2019ll be safe\u2026 <i>at least for a while.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/9a6b33a5398bb423e8888acac6694875.poster.avif?t=1773135169\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/9a6b33a5398bb423e8888acac6694875.webm?t=1773135169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>AVOID THE RESIDENTS</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhabitants of the Maw have only one use for children, and it\u2019s never pretty. Children who don\u2019t want to get caught should stay hidden and move carefully when they\u2019re around. Under certain circumstances, a distraction might avert their attention long enough for you to scuttle away scott-free. Be careful, if you accidentally make too much noise, the Residents are <i>quite determined</i> once you\u2019ve caught their eye. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/40505875083490228884fba947e9ae2d.poster.avif?t=1773135169\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/40505875083490228884fba947e9ae2d.webm?t=1773135169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>RUN FOR YOUR LIFE</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, there\u2019s no other choice but to run. If you can stay alive long enough to get somewhere the Residents can\u2019t reach you, you <i>might</i> survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/49342b9ab1325a23f8cd8f521679d24d.poster.avif?t=1773135169\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/extras/49342b9ab1325a23f8cd8f521679d24d.webm?t=1773135169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it through the Maw to freedom? Six is counting on you. <i>Good luck, little one.</i></p>","developers":["Tarsier Studios"],"dlc":[640920,584095,584096,584097,584090,584091,584092,584094,601710],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424840/facf9a7a675c6d7f210d96d6b111caffe0386cd5/header.jpg?t=1773135169","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Little Nightmares\u2122 & \u00a9BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Europe.<br />\r\nUnreal, Unreal Engine, the circle-U logo and the Powered by Unreal Engine logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States and elsewhere.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":81,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/little-nightmares?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/424840/127254/7ce709c8815248f5d6729efcedca0cd26d2eada1/1750529308/dash_av1.mpd?t=1507652098","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/424840/127254/7ce709c8815248f5d6729efcedca0cd26d2eada1/1750529308/das